" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Donor Appointment Booking ─ End-to-End Data Path</text>\n</svg>",
    "resourceSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 160\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <filter id=\"res-glow-01\" filterUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"160\">\n      <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2\" result=\"blur\" />\n      <feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"blur\" /><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\" /></feMerge>\n    </filter>\n  </defs>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"15\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CPU &amp; Memory Utilization — Before vs After Optimization</text>\n  <!-- CPU Section -->\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"'Outfit'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#64748b\">CPU LOAD</text>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"30\" width=\"340\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#f857a6\" filter=\"url(#res-glow-01)\" rx=\"3\" opacity=\"0.7\" />\n  <text x=\"460\" y=\"41\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#f857a6\">78%</text>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#10b981\" filter=\"url(#res-glow-01)\" rx=\"3\" />\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#10b981\">28% (Redis offload)</text>\n  <!-- RAM Section -->\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"'Outfit'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#64748b\">RAM USAGE</text>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"80\" width=\"300\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#f857a6\" filter=\"url(#res-glow-01)\" rx=\"3\" opacity=\"0.7\" />\n  <text x=\"420\" y=\"91\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#f857a6\">512MB</text>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"100\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#10b981\" filter=\"url(#res-glow-01)\" rx=\"3\" />\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"111\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#10b981\">184MB (indexed)</text>\n  <!-- Legend -->\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"130\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#f857a6\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"0.7\" />\n  <text x=\"156\" y=\"139\" font-family=\"'Outfit'\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Without Optimization</text>\n  <rect x=\"280\" y=\"130\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#10b981\" rx=\"2\" />\n  <text x=\"296\" y=\"139\" font-family=\"'Outfit'\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">With Queue Workers &amp; Index Scans</text>\n</svg>",
    "resourceDesc": "This comparison reveals how offloading background jobs to Redis queue workers and applying PostgreSQL index-only scans reduced peak CPU usage from 78% to 28% and memory consumption from 512MB to 184MB during high-concurrency blood inventory operations.",
    "roi": [
      "Zero double-allocation incidents: SERIALIZABLE isolation prevents race conditions across simultaneous O-negative requests from multiple clinics, eliminating critical medical errors.",
      "64% reduction in server CPU load: By delegating email alerts and report generation to isolated Redis queue workers, the main Laravel API threads remain free for real-time clinical operations.",
      "Sub-millisecond query latency at 200 req/s: Custom composite indexes and index-only scans guarantee that inventory lookups never exceed 0.1ms, even under emergency peak loads."
    ],
